@startuml academic-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (academic-service) - FR-02\nOwner: Ahmed Mohamed Ahmed
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IGoal <<provided>> {
  +CreateGoalAsync(studentId, data): Task<Goal>
  +UpdateGoalAsync(goalId, data): Task<Goal>
  +CompleteGoalAsync(goalId): Task<Goal>
  +ArchiveGoalAsync(goalId): Task<Goal>
  +RestoreGoalAsync(goalId): Task<Goal>
  +DeleteGoalAsync(goalId): Task
  +GetGoalAsync(goalId): Task<Goal?>
  +GetGoalsAsync(studentId, status): Task<List<Goal>>
}

class GoalService <<component>> {
  -repository: IGoalRepository
  --
  +CreateGoalAsync(...) / UpdateGoalAsync(...)
  +CompleteGoalAsync(...) / ArchiveGoalAsync(...)
  +RestoreGoalAsync(...) / DeleteGoalAsync(...)
  +GetGoalsAsync(...) / GetGoalAsync(...)
}

interface IGoalRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +AddAsync(goal): Task<Goal>
  +GetByIdAsync(goalId): Task<Goal?>
  +Update(goal): Task
  +Delete(goal): Task
  +UpdateAsync(goal): Task
  +DeleteAsync(goal): Task
  +Query(): IQueryable<Goal>
}

class GoalRepository <<component>> {
  -context: AcademicDbContext
  --
  +AddAsync(...) / GetByIdAsync(...)
  +UpdateAsync(...) / DeleteAsync(...)
  +Query()
}

class AcademicDbContext {
  +Goals: DbSet<Goal>
}

class Goal {
  -goalId: String
  -studentId: String
  -title: String
  -description: String
  -targetDate: DateOnly
  -priority: String
  -status: GoalStatus
  -completionDate: DateOnly?
  --
  +complete(): void
  +archive(): void
  +restore(): void
}
enum GoalStatus {
  Active
  Completed
  Archived
}

IGoal <|.. GoalService
GoalService --> IGoalRepository
GoalRepository ..|> IGoalRepository
GoalRepository --> AcademicDbContext
AcademicDbContext --> Goal
Goal --> GoalStatus
note bottom of GoalService
SOLID applied:
S - GoalService owns goal lifecycle rules; GoalRepository persists; AcademicDbContext maps.
O - new behaviour is added by new implementations, not by editing GoalService.
L - GoalService can replace any other IGoal implementation.
I - IGoal has only the operations its clients use.
D - GoalService depends on IGoalRepository, not on GoalRepository.
end note
@enduml
